Package: pnr
Title: Danish CPR Numbers: Cleaning, Derived Information, Diagnosis and Pseudonyms
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Daniel", "Madsen", email = "danielmadsen@live.dk",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Work with Danish CPR numbers (personnumre) in register data.
    Standardise the identifier, derive birth date, age, sex and validity in
    one native pass, diagnose what is wrong with a CPR column before it is
    used as a key, and replace the identifier with a random serial number
    before data leaves a secure environment.
